# Keep the build context clean: only source is copied in, everything is built
# fresh inside the image. Patterns are "**/"-prefixed so NESTED build artifacts
# (apps/web/.next, packages/*/dist, apps/*/node_modules) are excluded too — a
# bare "dist" / ".next" / "node_modules" only matches the context root and lets
# local dev artifacts (e.g. a stale .next/dev from `next dev`) leak into the image.
**/.git
**/.next
**/dist
**/node_modules
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
secrets
agent-changes
plans
services/node-agent/build
